Package: R8
Title: Structs, Enums, and Traits with a 'Rust' Runtime
Version: 0.6.0
Date: 2026-11-18
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "E.D.", family = "Gennatas", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "gennatas@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9280-3609")),
    person(given = "Authors of the bundled Rust crates", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "Rust crates compiled into the package; see inst/AUTHORS")
    )
Description: A type system for R whose runtime is the 'rtemis-r8' 'Rust'
    crate, shared with other host languages. Types are structs, enums, and
    traits, declared in R or in 'Rust'; values are immutable and validated
    once per value, and one declaration drives validation, JSON encoding,
    and hashing.
URL: https://docs.rtemis.org/r/r8-api/,
    https://www.rtemis.org, https://github.com/rtemis-org/r8
BugReports: https://github.com/rtemis-org/r8/issues
